Far cry from perfection and not the full one but before translating
numerous strings one has to determine what style they ll be using. It s
important to retain the same style throughout the whole project. Many words
that seem not to be connected appear to form semantic classes when
translating to lojban. thus a uniformity is highly desirable. In fact it
makes the purpose of the program more obvious and improves usability. But
for now feedback for what has been done needed

http://sourceforge.net/projects/skypeinyourlang/files/Lojban.lang/download

(you need to load that file into Skype menu => Tools => Choose language =>
Load language...)

